
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>PIVO LIVE</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#100c16;color:white;font-family:Arial}
header{background:#1b1425;padding:22px 5%;border-bottom:1px solid #392b49}
.logo{font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;color:#b58aff}
main{max-width:1400px;margin:30px auto;padding:0 20px}
.channels{display:flex;gap:12px;margin:20px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
button{background:#342343;color:white;border:1px solid #59416f;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}
button.active{background:#9147ff}
.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 320px;gap:15px}
.panel{background:#1c1624;border:1px solid #392b49;border-radius:13px;overflow:hidden}
iframe{border:0;width:100%;display:block}
#video{aspect-ratio:16/9}
#chat{height:600px}
.info{padding:15px}
@media(max-width:800px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}#chat{height:400px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="logo">🍺 PIVO LIVE</div></header>
<main>
<h1>Твои любимые стримеры</h1>
<p style="color:#aaa">Выбери трансляцию:</p>
<div class="channels">
<button id="b1" onclick="load('yurapivo')">🍺 Юра Пиво</button>
<button id="b2" onclick="load('r4dom1r_')">🎮 Рома Радамир</button>
</div>
<div class="layout">
<section class="panel">
<iframe id="video" allowfullscreen allow="autoplay;fullscreen" title="Twitch player"></iframe>
<div class="info"><h2 id="title">Выбери канал</h2><span>Официальный Twitch-плеер</span></div>
</section>
<section class="panel">
<div class="info"><b>💬 Чат</b></div>
<iframe id="chat" title="Twitch chat"></iframe>
</section>
</div>
</main>
<script>
function load(channel){
const parent=location.hostname;
document.getElementById('title').textContent=channel;
document.getElementById('video').src=
'https://player.twitch.tv/?channel='+encodeURIComponent(channel)+
'&parent='+encodeURIComponent(parent)+'&muted=true';
document.getElementById('chat').src=
'https://www.twitch.tv/embed/'+encodeURIComponent(channel)+
'/chat?parent='+encodeURIComponent(parent)+'&darkpopout';
document.getElementById('b1').classList.toggle('active',channel==='yurapivo');
document.getElementById('b2').classList.toggle('active',channel==='r4dom1r_');
}
load('yurapivo');
</script>
</body>
</html>
